    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEm">II Em</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be fæhþe.] [Ld] Witan scylon fæhðe sectan: ærest æfter folcrihte slaga sceal his forspecan on hand syllan ⁊ se forspeca magum, þæt se slaga wille betan wið mægðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The authorities must put a stop to vendetta. First, according to the public law, the slayer shall give security to his advocate, and the advocate to the kinsmen [of the slain man], that he [the slayer] will make reparation to the kindred.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Witan scylan fæhðe sectan: ærest æfter folcrihte slaga sceal his forspecan on hand syllan, ⁊ se forspeca magum, þæt se slaga wylle betan wið mægðe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
